            "value" : "任务行大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Task row size changes how much each task takes up in your lists. Compact fits more on screen; Large makes tasks easier to read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务行大小决定每个任务在列表中占用的空间。“紧凑”可在屏幕上显示更多任务；“大”则更易阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Task title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks you add from the Inbox or through Siri go to the default project. Automatic uses your project named Inbox, or your first project if there is none. Default due time applies when those tasks get a due date: pick a time later in the day so a new task does not show as overdue right away. Smart parsing reads dates, +project, !priority and *label from what you type in the quick-add bar and shows each one as a chip you can remove before adding." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从收件箱或通过 Siri 添加的任务会进入默认项目。“自动”会使用名为“收件箱”的项目，如果没有，则使用第一个项目。默认截止时间在这些任务获得截止日期时生效：请选择当天较晚的时间，以免新任务立即显示为逾期。开启智能解析后，mDone 会从你在快速添加栏中输入的内容里识别日期、+项目、!优先级和 *标签，并把每一项显示为一个标签块，你可以在添加前移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks you mark as Current sit at the top of your list with a progress bar. An idle badge appears when one hasn't been touched for this many days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标记为“当前”的任务会带着进度条置于列表顶部。任务超过指定天数未更新时会显示闲置标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That two-factor code wasn't accepted. Codes change every 30 seconds, so check your authenticator app and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双重认证验证码未被接受。验证码每30秒更新一次，请检查身份验证器应用后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request timed out. Please check your connection and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请求超时。请检查网络连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server URL doesn't look right. Please check it in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器 URL 似乎不正确，请在“设置”中检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is having trouble. Please try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器出现问题，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is rate limiting requests. Wait a moment and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器限制了请求频率，请稍候再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server may be temporarily unavailable. Wait a moment and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器可能暂时不可用，请稍候再试。"
