    },
    "mDone could not open its offline database, so the cached copy of your tasks was rebuilt. Everything reloads from the server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mDone 无法打开离线数据库，因此已重建任务缓存。所有内容将从服务器重新加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mDone could not open or recreate its offline database, so it is running without one. Your tasks still load from the server, but anything you change offline will be lost when you quit the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mDone 无法打开或重新创建离线数据库，因此目前未使用离线数据库运行。任务仍会从服务器加载，但离线时所做的任何更改都会在退出应用后丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mDone has no calendars to show. Grant calendar access in the Calendar tab first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
